msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f58f3bcf03fbab8bc79bc9e707e7c3fde5ff0d6c4f6f85d70c13eb69b5ba5447
#. default-sha256: 60c07d8cd4cf8b17b298f9597c116979301d46f410cb591780f306155f86f09e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No. Out with the negative thoughts. ⟪k:1⟫Gotta stay positive.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yeah! He hasn’t tried "
"to chase me out yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No. Basta con questi pensieri negativi. ⟪k:1⟫Devo rimanere positiva.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Già! Finora "
"non ha mai provato a cacciarmi di casa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c6fe254e52bc6e8ca7c515b40c76a846c4d3eb4d5f274a04e3167bdf4d50178
#. default-sha256: e03c5b1f58327ddf20fc9cc323d47379e50a99006744a640c87f07902f30d8f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just... ⟪k:1⟫haven’t broken the ice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ solo che... ⟪k:3⟫non abbiamo ancora rotto il ghiaccio."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96a0e7aa1f5ad0fc5017031ecc42ff9a700eeb45123c3a7affded96143ef6499
#. default-sha256: 1eeac337e6ada1e0305aa66e17aef0905c2b21f6fc06eb0bbb6cc50796c1fab5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to stay positive. ⟪k:1⟫Optimistic. ⟪k:2⟫Happy thoughts. ⟪k:3⟫And be myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dovevo continuare ad essere positiva. ⟪k:1⟫Ottimista. ⟪k:2⟫Allegra.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dovevo "
"continuare ad essere me stessa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c30a59d4a39bf64a1d401cdaf25ed6afa9eebef6896f706dc9d857f7f3c6ffaa
#. default-sha256: 913226bb133999ecaa804d917bc47fe00e1035ac63ccf2fdc5cc5c46eb213479
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as I kept working at it, with enough time, Michel would surely come around and not "
"be so distant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fintanto che avrei continuato a lavorarci su, col tempo,⟪k:1⟫Michel avrebbe cambiato "
"sicuramente idea, e avrebbe smesso⟪k:2⟫di essere così distante."

#: scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4915026c57fc8baca02120086acb0f381aafda166c6de9f5e14456c7bc9b5a13
#. default-sha256: cf94aae5d777065d30200f83f733f50fde67d0007d1f9970824996a08999474c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve got a goal, so let’s get to work!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First, I make supper, then I ask him to have "
"it with me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho un obiettivo, quindi mettiamoci al lavoro!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per prima cosa, preparerò la cena,"
"⟪k:3⟫e poi gli chiederò se vuole mangiare con me!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 305a9695e0ad00bde3af93de3701a312646f78d73c793bfabfdae8d6c014362a
#. default-sha256: 4ed7f3905a08130d490d09a2c3581778ca63ae72578fa14605015e44a8d3ebb3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gotta be proactive when it comes to the reclusive types.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All right, here goes!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bisogna essere intraprendenti quando si ha a che fare con dei reclusi del genere.⟪k:1⟫ "
"D’accordo, eccomi che arrivo!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ddbee88cfb164e43e8f9a31124f1d02bb4e6ce0a01b7a8d498d02439c34ce53
#. default-sha256: 78849769453bcaf723eca9a61ba4eaae3e52791454b5db5029b5a9bd7b7de9ae
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Or, here ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ go..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Aspetta un momento."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fd2b4461627bcad872840bd99b52c328e60c193a04d24dec80b9b509b05cce2
#. default-sha256: fef05d4b87d98b4c24bee7b96b1c9487cff0b598be0c189da218ae60df6d3924
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but we’re almost out of supplies."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Abbiamo quasi finito le scorte."

#: scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95471f7963416641732c1238c58970bba07f9d4877c4ae91e5ebcfe78cd9b4ac
#. default-sha256: 3302ec7bda0b71f3ae9dc2fb90707bfd40cfb284e14cbd32398b4310ab210756
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, so much for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Beh, come non detto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03e908322da4c89143101f26c9424d80032fab445bdbd4fada2e10c9dbbaacf2
#. default-sha256: 9b199fe6315350b898a81b33105411a7fc0fc6e96b2a80e4858c8f91d973853a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where the nonperishable food was stored. ⟪k:1⟫Dried foods, smoked meats, "
"cheeses, and a small scattering of root vegetables."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La cantina era dove veniva tenuto il cibo a lunga conservazione.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cibi secchi, carni "
"e formaggi affumicati, e una manciata di ortaggi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7ff9dcfc2ff9425f68182760ae3da38a8d1ec07babd2848b4cb11a0544c6cea
#. default-sha256: 8f4adc548a20edb5c0ca9087445505e058c424e3b58a91f32de20f278a0cde6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Looking at this makes me feel like a soldier holding down a castle’s fortifications."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Davanti a tutta questa roba mi sento come se fossi un soldato a guardia delle fortificazioni "
"di un castello."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DFC7153C_F91F_4BF4_8171_C97CFDF5C923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ae441d150785a88c9fb6f4886e30495e0e619cd3e475ea40de0178f60876618
#. default-sha256: 09ea872796e744e8e7a38b047eff46aa6de1da45a416e43ed81e68f37ca00cb6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DFC7153C_F91F_4BF4_8171_C97CFDF5C923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Michel really gone ten years on nothing but this?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I would have raised the white "
"flag long ago."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Davvero Michel non aveva mangiato nient’altro per dieci anni?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Io avrei alzato "
"bandiera bianca molto prima."

#: scenario5:scenario5_906466F2_7ED7_4E86_95B3_B101047690F5
